      "ViciOne.ServiceBus.Tests.Pipeline.Specifying_a_rate_limit.Should_only_do_n_messages_per_interval"
    ],
    "explanation": "A fixture named Specifying_a_rate_limit exists in both the Middleware and the Pipeline namespace. Their last class segment is identical, so two of the four identities collapse into two names. The same effect turns the original 43 identities into the 41 entries of the not executed inventory."
  },
